## TwoColumnLayout

## Installation

Method: \`npm install sindlish\`

Install the Sindlish compiler from npm.

**Example:**

\`\`\`javascript
// Sindlish hello world
print("Hello, Sindlish!")
\`\`\`

## Configure environment

Set the \`DATABASE_URL\` environment variable.

For more details, see the [language documentation](https://sindlish.org/docs/reference/keywords).

